Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:11:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 08/37] bitproxy: service start fallback and failure
 notification

- When the system starts the VPN (Always-on, boot) and no usable profile
  is selected, fall back to the BitProxy profile.
- Start failures now raise a notification with the sing-box error, so
  they are visible when the UI is closed (e.g. Always-on after boot).
- Apply turns off upstream per-app proxy: its VpnService include/exclude
  lists cut excluded apps off under lockdown.
Upstream hooks: two one-line calls in BoxService.
